# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Market split problem {#market-split-problem}"
msgstr "Masalah market split {#market-split-problem}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The market split problem is a real-world, NP-hard resource allocation problem and has become a benchmark for quantum optimization algorithms.\n"
"It represents a high-stakes logistical challenge: how to partition a complex landscape of customers and products into manageable, equalized territories.\n"
msgstr ""
"Masalah market split adalah masalah alokasi sumber daya dunia nyata yang bersifat NP-hard dan telah menjadi benchmark untuk algoritme optimisasi kuantum.\n"
"Ini merepresentasikan tantangan logistik yang berisiko tinggi: bagaimana membagi lanskap pelanggan dan produk yang kompleks menjadi wilayah-wilayah yang dapat dikelola dan setara.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The goal is to divide $n$ markets into two balanced sales regions such that each region receives exactly half the total demand for $m$ products.\n"
"The solution is the specific configuration that achieves the most even distribution of product demand possible, allowing a company to implement a logistics and staffing strategy where both regions are balanced,\n"
"minimizing the risks such as localized product shortages or warehouse overflows.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tujuannya adalah membagi $n$ pasar menjadi dua wilayah penjualan yang seimbang sedemikian rupa sehingga setiap wilayah menerima tepat setengah dari total permintaan untuk $m$ produk.\n"
"Solusinya adalah konfigurasi spesifik yang mencapai distribusi permintaan produk paling merata yang mungkin, memungkinkan sebuah perusahaan menerapkan strategi logistik dan staf di mana kedua wilayah seimbang,\n"
"meminimalkan risiko seperti kekurangan produk lokal atau kelebihan kapasitas gudang.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As the number of markets and products increases, the number of possible permutations grows exponentially, making it challenging to find the best split using traditional exhaustive searches.\n"
msgstr "Seiring bertambahnya jumlah pasar dan produk, jumlah kemungkinan permutasi tumbuh secara eksponensial, sehingga menyulitkan pencarian pembagian terbaik menggunakan pencarian menyeluruh (exhaustive search) tradisional.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mathematical formulation {#mathematical-formulation}"
msgstr "Formulasi matematis {#mathematical-formulation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let $A$ be an $m \\times n$ matrix representing the demand of products across markets, where $A_{ij}$ is the demand for product $i$ in market $j$.\n"
msgstr "Misalkan $A$ adalah matriks $m \\times n$ yang merepresentasikan permintaan produk di seluruh pasar, di mana $A_{ij}$ adalah permintaan untuk produk $i$ di pasar $j$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A binary assignment vector, $x = [x_1, x_2, \\dots, x_n]^T \\in \\{0, 1\\}^n$, is defined where:\n"
"* $x_j = 1$ assigns market $j$ to Region A.\n"
"* $x_j = 0$ assigns market $j$ to Region B.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebuah vektor penugasan biner, $x = [x_1, x_2, \\dots, x_n]^T \\in \\{0, 1\\}^n$, didefinisikan di mana:\n"
"* $x_j = 1$ menugaskan pasar $j$ ke Wilayah A.\n"
"* $x_j = 0$ menugaskan pasar $j$ ke Wilayah B.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let $d = [d_1, d_2, \\dots, d_m]^T$ be the total demand vector for each product, calculated as $d = A \\cdot \\mathbf{1}$. The target sales volume per region for product $i$ is exactly $\\frac{d_i}{2}$.\n"
msgstr "Misalkan $d = [d_1, d_2, \\dots, d_m]^T$ adalah vektor total permintaan untuk setiap produk, dihitung sebagai $d = A \\cdot \\mathbf{1}$. Target volume penjualan per wilayah untuk produk $i$ adalah tepat $\\frac{d_i}{2}$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The optimization or feasibility constraint requires that the total sales allocated to Region A perfectly matches half the total demand for every product:\n"
msgstr "Kendala optimisasi atau kelayakan mensyaratkan bahwa total penjualan yang dialokasikan ke Wilayah A sama persis dengan setengah dari total permintaan untuk setiap produk:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$A x = \\frac{1}{2} A \\mathbf{1} = b.$$\n"
msgstr "$$A x = \\frac{1}{2} A \\mathbf{1} = b.$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In practice, because exact division is rarely possible, the problem is formulated to minimize the squared constraint violation (the cost function):\n"
msgstr "Dalam praktiknya, karena pembagian yang eksak jarang memungkinkan, masalah ini diformulasikan untuk meminimalkan pelanggaran kendala kuadrat (fungsi biaya):\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$\\min_{x} \\left\\Vert{} A x - b \\right\\Vert{}^2 = \\sum_{i=1}^{m} \\left( \\sum_{j=1}^{n} A_{ij} x_j - b\\right)^2.$$\n"
msgstr "$$\\min_{x} \\left\\Vert{} A x - b \\right\\Vert{}^2 = \\sum_{i=1}^{m} \\left( \\sum_{j=1}^{n} A_{ij} x_j - b\\right)^2.$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Expanding this gives a form that is equivalent to a quadratic unconstrained binary optimization (QUBO) problem.\n"
msgstr "Memperluas ini menghasilkan bentuk yang setara dengan masalah quadratic unconstrained binary optimization (QUBO).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upon solving, the solution vector $x$ dictates to which region the market is assigned. This is the configuration that achieves the most balanced distribution of product demand possible.\n"
msgstr "Setelah diselesaikan, vektor solusi $x$ menentukan ke wilayah mana sebuah pasar ditugaskan. Ini adalah konfigurasi yang mencapai distribusi permintaan produk paling seimbang yang mungkin.\n"

